# Secrets and samples

- Commit only synthetic files under `audit_ai/samples/`.
- `audit_ai/data/`, `.env`, and database files stay untracked.
- Do not hard-code API keys. Read endpoints from the environment and pass them through the host allowlist.
- Prototype accounts exist for local demo. Do not reuse that password anywhere else.
- Do not add real invoices, payroll, or customer identifiers to the repository.
